      "questionNumber": "01",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "$\\toM=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 2 & 1\\\\ 3 & -3 & -1\\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{matrix}]$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$[\\begin{matrix}2 & -x\\\\ y-1 & 2\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}2 & 3+y\\\\ 4 & 2\\end{matrix}]$ হলে $(x,y)$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $[\\begin{matrix}2 & -x\\\\ y-1 & 2\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}2 & 3+y\\\\ 4 & 2\\end{matrix}]$\nম্যাট্রিক্সের সমতা অনুসারে,\n$y-1=4$ \n$∴y=5$\n$-x=3+y$\nবা, $-x=3+5 ∴x=-8$\n$∴(x,y)=(-8,5)$ (Ans.)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "${M}^{2}-3M+MI$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর, যেখানে I একক ম্যাট্রিক্স।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $M=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 2 & 1\\\\ 3 & -3 & -1\\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{matrix}]$\n$∴{M}^{2}=M\\timesM=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 2 & 1\\\\ 3 & -3 & -1\\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{matrix}][\\begin{matrix}1 & 2 & 1\\\\ 3 & -3 & -1\\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{matrix}]$\n$=[\\begin{matrix}1+6+2 & 2-6+1 & 1-2+0\\\\ 3-9-2 & 6+9-1 & 3+3-0\\\\ 2+3+0 & 4-3+0 & 2-1+0\\end{matrix}]=[\\begin{matrix}9 & -3 & -1\\\\ -8 & 14 & 6\\\\ 5 & 1 & 1\\end{matrix}]$\nপ্রদত্ত রাশি $={M}^{2}-3M+MI$\n$=[\\begin{matrix}9 & -3 & -1\\\\ -8 & 14 & 6\\\\ 5 & 1 & 1\\end{matrix}]-3[\\begin{matrix}1 & 2 & 1\\\\ 3 & -3 & -1\\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{matrix}]+[\\begin{matrix}1 & 2 & 1\\\\ 3 & -3 & -1\\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{matrix}][\\begin{matrix}1 & 0 & 0\\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{matrix}]$\n$=[\\begin{matrix}9 & -3 & -1\\\\ -8 & 14 & 6\\\\ 5 & 1 & 1\\end{matrix}]-[\\begin{matrix}3 & 6 & 3\\\\ 9 & -9 & -3\\\\ 6 & 3 & 0\\end{matrix}]+[\\begin{matrix}1 & 2 & 1\\\\ 3 & -3 & -1\\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{matrix}]$\n$=[\\begin{matrix}9-3+1 & -3-6+2 & -1-3+1\\\\ -8-9+3 & 14+9-3 & 6+3-1\\\\ 5-6+2 & 1-3+1 & 1-0+0\\end{matrix}]$\n$=[\\begin{matrix}7 & -7 & -3\\\\ -14 & 20 & 8\\\\ 1 & -1 & 1\\end{matrix}]\\text{ (Ans.) }$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "M এর বিপরীত ম্যাট্রিক্স বিদ্যমান থাকলে তা নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$|M|=|\\begin{matrix}1 & 2 & 1\\\\ 3 & -3 & -1\\\\ 2 & 1 & 0\\end{matrix}|$\n$=1(-0+1)-2(0+2)+1(3+6)$\n$=1-4+9=6\\neq0$\n$∴{M}^{-1}$ নির্ণয়যোগ্য।\n$adjM={[\\begin{matrix}|\\begin{matrix}-3 & -1\\\\ 1 & 0\\end{matrix}| & -|\\begin{matrix}3 & -1\\\\ 2 & 0\\end{matrix}| & |\\begin{matrix}3 & -3\\\\ 2 & 1\\end{matrix}|\\\\ -|\\begin{matrix}2 & 1\\\\ 1 & 0\\end{matrix}| & |\\begin{matrix}1 & 1\\\\ 2 & 0\\end{matrix}| & -|\\begin{matrix}1 & 2\\\\ 2 & 1\\end{matrix}|\\\\ |\\begin{matrix}2 & 1\\\\ -3 & -1\\end{matrix}| & -|\\begin{matrix}1 & 1\\\\ 3 & -1\\end{matrix}| & |\\begin{matrix}1 & 2\\\\ 3 & -3\\end{matrix}|\\end{matrix}]}^{t}$\n$={[\\begin{matrix}1 & -2 & 9\\\\ 1 & -2 & 3\\\\ 1 & 4 & -9\\end{matrix}]}^{t}=[\\begin{matrix}1 & 1 & 1\\\\ -2 & -2 & 4\\\\ 9 & 3 & -9\\end{matrix}]$\n$∴{M}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{|M|}$ adj $M=\\frac{1}{6}[\\begin{matrix}1 & 1 & 1\\\\ -2 & -2 & 4\\\\ 9 & 3 & -9\\end{matrix}]$ (Ans.)"
          }
        }
      ],
