      "questionNumber": "06",
      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "$A,B⊂\\tilde{N},B=\\tilde{N}-\\{\\frac{1}{3}\\},g:A\\toB,g(x)=\\frac{x-5}{3x+1}$ এবং $h(x)={x}^{2}+1$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\sin{e}^{\\sqrt{1-x}}$ এর অন্তরক সহগ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\begin{matrix}\\frac{d}{dx}(\\sin{e}^{\\sqrt{1-x}}) & =\\cos{e}^{\\sqrt{1-x}}\\cdot\\frac{d}{dx}{e}^{\\sqrt{1-x}}\\\\ & =\\cos{e}^{\\sqrt{1-x}}\\cdot{e}^{\\sqrt{1-x}}\\cdot\\frac{d}{dx}\\sqrt{1-x}\\\\ & =\\cos{e}^{\\sqrt{1-x}}\\cdot{e}^{\\sqrt{1-x}}(-\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{1-x}})\\\\ & =-\\frac{{e}^{\\sqrt{1-x}}}{2\\sqrt{1-x}}\\cos{e}^{\\sqrt{1-x}}\\end{matrix}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "দেখাও যে, (hog) (1) - (goh) (2)=2."
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $g(x)=\\frac{x-5}{3x+1}$ এবং $h(x)={x}^{2}+1$\n(hog) $(x)=h(g(x))=h(\\frac{x-5}{3x+1})={(\\frac{x-5}{3x+1})}^{2}+1$\n$∴ (hog)(1)={(\\frac{1-5}{3.1+1})}^{2}+1={(\\frac{-4}{3+1})}^{2}+1={(\\frac{-4}{4})}^{2}+1$\n$=(-1{)}^{2}+1=1+1=2$\n$(goh)(x)=g(h(x))=g({x}^{2}+1)$\n$=\\frac{{x}^{2}+1-5}{3\\cdot({x}^{2}+1)+1}=\\frac{{x}^{2}-4}{3{x}^{2}+3+1}=\\frac{{x}^{2}-4}{3{x}^{2}+4}$\n$(goh)(2)=\\frac{{2}^{2}-4}{{3.2}^{2}+4}=\\frac{4-4}{3.4+4}=\\frac{0}{12+4}=0$\nবামপক্ষ = (hog) (1)-(goh) (2) \n= 2-0=2 = ডানপক্ষ\n$∴($ hog $)(1)-(g\\circh)(2)=2$ . (দেখানো হলো)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "অস্তিত্ব যাচাইপূর্বক ${g}^{-1}(x)$ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "এখানে, $A,B⊂R;B=R-\\{\\frac{1}{3}\\};g:A\\toB;g(x)=\\frac{x-5}{3x+1}$\nধরি, ${x}_{1},{x}_{2}∈R$\n$g({x}_{1})=g({x}_{2})$ হলে, $\\frac{{x}_{1}-5}{3{x}_{1}+1}=\\frac{{x}_{2}-5}{3{x}_{2}+1}$\nবা, $3{x}_{1}{x}_{2}+{x}_{1}-15{x}_{2}-5=3{x}_{1}{x}_{2}-15{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}-5$\nবা, $3{x}_{1}{x}_{2}+{x}_{1}-3{x}_{1}{x}_{2}+15{x}_{1}={x}_{2}-5+15{x}_{2}+5$\nবা, $16{x}_{1}=16{x}_{2}$\nবা, ${x}_{1}=\\frac{16{x}_{2}}{16}$\nবা, ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}$\n$∴g(x)$ একটি এক-এক ফাংশन।\nআবার, ধরি, $y=g(x)=\\frac{x-5}{3x+1}$\nএখন, $y=\\frac{x-5}{3x+1}$\nবা, $3xy+y=x-5$\nবা, $3xy-x=-y-5$\nবা, $x(3y-1)=-y-5$\nবা, $x=\\frac{-y-5}{3y-1}=\\frac{-(y+5)}{-(1-3y)}=\\frac{y+5}{1-3y}$\n$g(\\frac{y+5}{1-3y})=\\frac{\\frac{y+5}{1-3y}-5}{3\\cdot\\frac{y+5}{1-3y}+1}=\\frac{\\frac{y+5-5+15y}{1-3y}}{\\frac{3y+15+1-3y}{1-3y}}=\\frac{\\frac{16y}{1-3y}}{\\frac{16}{1-3y}}$\n$∴ g(\\frac{y+5}{1-3y})=y$\n$∴ g(x)$ একটি সার্বিক ফাংশন।\nসুতরাং ${g}^{-1}(x)$ নির্ণয়যোগ্য।\nআবার, $y=g(x)$\nবা, ${g}^{-1}(y)=x$\nএখন, $x=\\frac{y+5}{1-3y}$\nবা, ${g}^{-1}(y)=\\frac{y+5}{1-3y}$\nবা, ${g}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x+5}{1-3x}$\nনির্ণেয় ${g}^{-1}(x)=\\frac{x+5}{1-3x}$ ."
          }
        }
      ],
