      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "$f(x)=\\lnx$ এবং $g(x)={e}^{x}$",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}\\frac{{e}^{2x}-1}{ax}$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\begin{matrix} & \\underset{x\\to0}{lim}\\frac{{e}^{2x}-1}{ax}\\\\ & =\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}\\frac{1+2x+\\frac{(2x{)}^{2}}{2!}+………….1}{ax}\\\\ & =\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}\\frac{x(2+2x+………..)}{ax}\\\\ & =\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}\\frac{2+2x+…………..}{a}\\\\ & =\\underset{x\\to0}{lim}\\frac{2}{a}(1+x+………..)\\\\ & =\\frac{2}{a}\\text{ (Ans.) }\\end{matrix}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\frac{f(2x)}{x}$ এর গুরুমান এবং লঘুমান বিদ্যমান থাকলে তা নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "দেওয়া আছে, $f(x)=\\lnx ∴f(2x)=\\ln2x$\nধরি, $y=\\frac{f(2x)}{x}=\\frac{\\ln2x}{x}$\n$∴\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{x\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln2x-\\ln2x\\frac{d}{dx}x}{{x}^{2}}$\n$=\\frac{x\\cdot\\frac{1}{2x}\\cdot2-\\ln2x\\cdot1}{{x}^{2}}=\\frac{1-\\ln2x}{{x}^{2}}$\nআবার, $\\frac{{d}^{2}y}{d{x}^{2}}=\\frac{{x}^{2}\\frac{d}{dx}(1-\\ln2x)-(1-\\ln2x)\\frac{d}{dx}{x}^{2}}{{({x}^{2})}^{2}}$\n$=\\frac{{x}^{2}(\\frac{-1}{2x}\\cdot2)-(1-\\ln2x)\\cdot2x}{{x}^{4}}$\n$=\\frac{-x-2x(1-\\ln2x)}{{x}^{4}}$\n$=\\frac{-1-2+2\\ln2x}{{x}^{3}}$\n$=\\frac{-3+2\\ln2x}{{x}^{3}}$\nলঘুমান ও গুরুমানের জন্য, $\\frac{dy}{dx}=0$\nবা, $\\frac{1-\\ln2x}{{x}^{2}}=0$\nবা, $1=\\ln2x$ বা, $\\ln2x=\\lne$\nবা, $2x=e ∴x=\\frac{e}{2}$\n$x=\\frac{e}{2}$ হলে, $\\frac{{d}^{2}y}{{dx}^{2}}=\\frac{-3+2\\ln2\\cdot\\frac{e}{2}}{{(\\frac{e}{2})}^{3}}=\\frac{-1}{\\frac{{e}^{3}}{8}}=\\frac{-8}{{e}^{3}}<0$\n$x=\\frac{e}{2}$ এর জন্য প্রদত্ত ফাংশনটির গুরুমান বিদ্যমান।\n$∴$ গুরুমান $=\\frac{\\ln2\\cdot\\frac{e}{2}}{\\frac{e}{2}}=\\frac{1}{\\frac{e}{2}}=\\frac{2}{e}$ (Ans.)"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "${\\int}_{1}^{{e}^{2}}\\frac{f(x)}{x}dx+{\\int}_{1}^{2}\\text{ }g(x)dx$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "ধরি, $\\lnx=z$\n$∴\\frac{1}{x}dx=dz$\n[IMG_0]\n$\\begin{matrix} & {\\int}_{1}^{{e}^{2}}\\frac{f(x)}{x}dx+{\\int}_{1}^{2}g(x)dx\\\\ & ={\\int}_{1}^{{e}^{2}}\\frac{\\lnx}{x}dx+{\\int}_{1}^{2}{e}^{x}dx\\\\ & ={\\int}_{0}^{2}zdz+{[{e}^{x}]}_{1}^{2}\\\\ & ={[\\frac{{z}^{2}}{2}]}_{0}^{2}+({e}^{2}-{e}^{1})\\\\ & =\\frac{4}{2}+{e}^{2}-e=2+{e}^{2}-e\\text{ (Ans.) }\\end{matrix}$"
          }
        }
