      "formatCode": "cq",
      "translations": {
        "bn": {
          "questionText": "$g(z)=mz{\\sin}^{-1}z$ একটি ফাংশন এবং $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{\\text{ }b}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}=1$ একটি বক্রররেখা।",
          "solutionText": null
        }
      },
      "parts": [
        {
          "ordinal": 1,
          "key": "A",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "${\\int}_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{z}\\cos(\\lnz)dz$ এর মান নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "ধরি, $\\lnz=x$\n$∴\\frac{1}{z}dz=dx$\n[IMG_0]\n$\\begin{matrix} & {\\int}_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{z}\\cos(\\lnz)dz\\\\ & ={\\int}_{0}^{\\ln2}\\cosxdx\\\\ & =[\\sinx{]}_{0}^{\\ln2}\\\\ & =\\sin(\\ln2)-\\sin0\\\\ & =\\sin(\\ln2)(\\text{ Ans.) }\\end{matrix}$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 2,
          "key": "B",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$\\intg(x)dx$ এর যোগজ নির্ণয় কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\intg(x)dx=\\intmx{\\sin}^{-1}xdx[<g(z)=mz{\\sin}^{-1}z]$\nএখন, $\\intx{\\sin}^{-1}xdx$\n$={\\sin}^{-1}x\\intxdx-\\int\\{\\frac{d}{dx}({\\sin}^{-1}x)\\intxdx\\}dx$\n$={\\sin}^{-1}x\\cdot\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-\\int\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}\\cdot\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}dx$\n$=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}dx$\n$=\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}I [I=\\int\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}dx$ ধরে \nধরি, $x=\\sin\\theta$\nবা, $\\theta={\\sin}^{-1}x$\n$∴dx=\\cos\\thetad\\theta$\nএখন, $I=\\int\\frac{{x}^{2}}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}}dx$\n$=\\int\\frac{{\\sin}^{2}\\theta}{\\sqrt{1-{\\sin}^{2}\\theta}}\\cdot\\cos\\thetad\\theta$\n$=\\int{\\sin}^{2}\\thetad\\theta$\n$=\\int\\frac{1}{2}(1-\\cos2\\theta)d\\theta$\n$=\\frac{1}{2}(\\theta-\\frac{1}{2}\\sin2\\theta)$\n$=\\frac{1}{2}({\\sin}^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta)$\n$∴I=\\frac{1}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}$\n$∴\\intg(x)dx=m\\intx{\\sin}^{-1}xdx$\n$=m[\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1}{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{2}x\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}})]+c$\n$=\\frac{1}{2}m{x}^{2}{\\sin}^{-1}x-\\frac{1}{4}m{\\sin}^{-1}x+\\frac{1}{4}mx\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}}+c\\text{ (Ans.) }$"
          }
        },
        {
          "ordinal": 3,
          "key": "C",
          "prompt": {
            "bn": "$b>a$ হলে উদ্দীপকে প্রদত্ত বক্ররেখা দ্বারা আবদ্ধ ক্ষেত্রের অর্ধাংশের ক্ষেত্রফল বের কর।"
          },
          "solution": {
            "bn": "$\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}=1$\n(i) নং $এy=0$ বসিয়ে পাই, ${x}^{2}={b}^{2}∴x=\\pmb$\nঅর্থাৎ উপবৃত্তটি x-অক্ষকে $(-b,0)$ ও $(b,0)$ বিন্দুতে ছেদ করে।\n[IMG_0]\nআবার, $x=0$ বসিয়ে পাই,\n${y}^{2}={a}^{2}$\n$∴y=\\pma$\n$∴$ উপবৃত্তটি $y$ -অক্ষকে $(0,-a)$ ও $(0,a)$ বিন্দুতে ছেদ করে।\nউপবৃত্ত দ্বারা আবদ্ধ ক্ষেত্রের অর্ধাংশের ক্ষেত্রফল\n$=2\\timesOABO$ ক্ষেত্রের ক্ষেত্রফল \nধরি, $x=b\\sin\\theta⇒dx=b\\cos\\thetad\\theta$\nযখন $x=0$ , তখন $\\theta=0$\nএবং যখন $x=b$ , তখন $\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n$=2{\\int}_{0}^{b}ydx$\n$=2{\\int}_{0}^{b}\\frac{a}{b}\\sqrt{{b}^{2}-{x}^{2}}dx$\n$=\\frac{2a}{b}{\\int}_{0}^{b}\\sqrt{{b}^{2}-{x}^{2}}dx$\n$=\\frac{2a}{b}{\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}\\sqrt{{b}^{2}-{b}^{2}{\\sin}^{2}\\theta}\\cdotb\\cos\\thetad\\theta$\n$=2a{\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}\\sqrt{{b}^{2}(1-{\\sin}^{2}\\theta)}\\cdot\\cos\\thetad\\theta$\n$=2ab{\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}\\sqrt{{\\cos}^{2}\\theta}\\cdot\\cos\\thetad\\theta=ab{\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}2{\\cos}^{2}\\thetad\\theta$\n$=ab{\\int}_{0}^{\\pi/2}(1+\\cos2\\theta)d\\theta=ab{[\\theta+\\frac{1}{2}\\sin2\\theta]}_{0}^{\\pi/2}$\n$=ab[\\frac{\\pi}{2}-0]=\\frac{\\piab}{2}$ বগ একক (Ans.)"
          }
        }
